#: ../../../reference/interfaces/userns-interface.md:2
msgid "userns interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/userns-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `userns` interface permits a snap to create new user [namespaces]"
"(https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/namespaces.7.html). This is a system-"
"level interface, and is not designed to be used with higher level snap "
"applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/userns-interface.md:7
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/userns-interface.md:9
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/userns-interface.md:9
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/userns-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"This interface  supports the inclusion of the appropriate AppArmor and "
"seccomp policies to allow user namespaces to be created when this interface "
"is plugged."
msgstr ""

